# game/chapter2.rpy:136
translate english chapter2_effort_q1_wrong_6ef3db56:

    # sys_voice "(Mali ang syntax. Sa interface config mode ng Cisco switch, \nkailangan mo munang i-set ang port sa access mode, bago i-assign sa specific VLAN.)"
    sys_voice "(Wrong syntax. In interface configuration mode on a Cisco switch, \nyou first need to set the port to access mode before assigning it to a specific VLAN.)"

# game/chapter2.rpy:161
translate english chapter2_effort_q2_correct_79e45c83:

    # sys_voice "(Tama! Bakit: 'switchport mode trunk' ang nagbubukas ng trunk mode, \ntapos 'switchport trunk allowed vlan' ang nagsasabi kung aling VLANs ang pwedeng dumaan.)"
    sys_voice "(Correct! Why: 'switchport mode trunk' opens trunk mode, \nthen 'switchport trunk allowed vlan' specifies which VLANs are allowed through.)"

# game/chapter2.rpy:165
translate english chapter2_effort_q2_wrong_e1903c33:

    # sys_voice "(Hindi tama. Sa Cisco switch, ang pag-set ng port sa trunk mode ay ginagawa gamit ang 'switchport mode trunk', \ntapos ise-specify kung aling mga VLAN ang pwedeng dumaan dito.)"
    sys_voice "(Incorrect. On a Cisco switch, setting a port to trunk mode is done with 'switchport mode trunk', \nthen you specify which VLANs are allowed through it.)"

# game/chapter2.rpy:190
translate english chapter2_effort_q3_correct_a590decc:

    # sys_voice "(Tama! Bakit: VLANs are created in global config mode, 'vlan <id>' first, then 'name' to label it, hindi sa interface o vlan database mode.)"
    sys_voice "(Correct! Why: VLANs are created in global config mode, 'vlan <id>' first, then 'name' to label it, not in interface or vlan database mode.)"

# game/chapter2.rpy:194
translate english chapter2_effort_q3_wrong_f3456edf:

    # sys_voice "(Hindi tama. Sa Cisco switch, ginagawa ang mga VLAN sa global configuration mode. \nUna, 'configure terminal', tapos ang command na 'vlan' na sinusundan ng VLAN number, tapos 'name' para i-label.)"
    sys_voice "(Incorrect. On a Cisco switch, VLANs are created in global configuration mode. \nFirst, 'configure terminal', then the 'vlan' command followed by the VLAN number, then 'name' to label it.)"

# game/chapter2.rpy:219
translate english chapter2_effort_q4_correct_a86e40ce:

    # sys_voice "(Tama! Bakit: 'show vlan brief' ang standard verification command, nagbibigay ito ng maikling summary ng VLANs at port assignments.)"
    sys_voice "(Correct! Why: 'show vlan brief' is the standard verification command, it gives a brief summary of VLANs and port assignments.)"

# game/chapter2.rpy:223
translate english chapter2_effort_q4_wrong_07d99fbc:

    # sys_voice "(May specific na 'show' command na nagbibigay ng maikling summary ng mga VLAN at ang port assignments nila. \nHint: isa 'yan sa pinaka-common na CCNA verification commands.)"
